hadiths[51]{hadithnumber,text}:
"520","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne sadqa-e-fitr Ramazan ke baad logon par aik sa' khajoor ya aik sa' jau farz kiya hai har azaad aur ghulam mard o aurat par jo Musalman ho. (Muslim)."
"521","[AI-translation] Abu Sa'id Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke daur mein sadqa-e-fitr har chotay baray, azaad aur ghulam ki taraf se aik sa' gandum ya aik sa' paneer ya jau ya khajoor ya angoor nikaltay thay. Phir jab Muawiya (raziyallahu anhu) Hajj ko ya Umra ko aaye to logon se mimbar par, kharay ho kar, waz kiya aur us mein kaha mera khayal hai ke Shaam ki gandum ke do mudd, yani nisf sa', aik sa' khajoor ke barabar hota hai. Yani qeemat mein. So logon ne us ko le liya. Aur Abu Sa'id (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke main to wohi nikalta rahun ga jo nikalta tha, yani aik sa', jab tak jiyun ga. SubhanAllah ye ittiba tha hadees ka aur nafrat thi raye aur qayaas se. (Muslim)."
"522","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne namaz, Eid, ko niklnay se pehle sadqa-e-fitr ada karnay ka hukm diya. (Muslim)."
"523","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Mujhe ye aarzu nahi hai ke ye Uhud ka pahar mere liye sona ho jaye aur teen din se zyada mere paas aik deenaar bhi baaqi rahay magar ye ke wo deenaar apne kisi qarz khwah ko denay ke liye bacha rakhun. (Muslim)."
"524","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Ae auraton ki jamaat! Tum sadqa do aur istighfar karo, kyunke main ne dekha ke jahannam mein zyada taadaad mein aurtein hain. Aik aqalmand aurat boli ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Kya sabab hai, aurtein kyun zyada jahannam mein hain? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke wo laanat bohat karti hain aur khawand ki naashukri karti hain. Main ne aqal aur deen mein kam aur aqalmand ko be-aqal karnay wali tum se zyada kisi ko na dekha. Wo aurat boli ke hamari aqal aur deen mein kya kami hai? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke aqal ki kami to us se maloom hoti hai ke do auraton ki gawahi aik mard ki gawahi ke barabar hai. Aur deen mein kami ye hai ke aurat kai din tak, har maheenay mein haiz ki wajah se, namaz nahi padhti aur Ramazan mein, haiz ke dinon mein, rozay nahi rakhti. (Muslim: 1/61). Baab: Kharch par ubharna. (Jazla se murad aqalmand hai; asheer se murad khawand hai.)"
"525","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ne Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat ki ke Allah Taala farmata hai: Ae Ibn Adam! Kharch kar ke main bhi tere upar kharch karun aur, Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne, farmaya ke Allah ka haath bhara hua hai, raat din kharch karnay se kuch kam nahi hota. (Muslim)."
"526","[AI-translation] Harisa bin Wahb (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko suna, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farmatay thay ke sadqa do. Qareeb hai ke aisa waqt aa jaye ga ke aadmi apna sadqa le kar niklay ga aur jis ko denay lagay ga wo kahay ga ke agar tum kal laatay to main le leta magar aaj to mujhe zaroorat nahi hai. Gharz koi na milay ga jo usay qabool kar le. (Muslim)."
"527","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Qayamat ke qareeb zameen apne jigar paaron ko bahar daal de gi jaisay baray baray satoon hotay hain, sonay se aur chaandi se. Phir qaatil aaye ga aur kahay ga ke isi ke liye main ne khoon kiya tha. Aur rishta daari kaatnay wala aaye ga aur kahay ga ke isi ke liye main ne apni rishtay daari tor li. Aur chor aaye ga aur kahay ga isi ke wastay mera haath kaata gaya. Phir sab ke sab usay chhor dein ge aur koi us mein se kuch na le ga. (Muslim)."
"528","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) ki biwi Zainab (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Ae auraton ki jamaat! Sadqa do agarchay apne zewar se ho. Unhon ne kaha ke phir main apne shohar Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) ke paas aayi aur main ne kaha ke tum muflis khaali haath aadmi ho, aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya hai ke ham log sadqa dein, so tum ja kar Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poocho ke agar main tum ko de dun aur sadqa ada ho jaye to khair warna aur kisi ko de dun gi. To Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke tum hi ja kar Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poocho. Phir main aayi aur aik Ansaari aurat Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke darwazay par khari thi, us ka bhi yehi kaam tha jo mera tha. Aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka rob bohat tha. Bilal (raziyallahu anhu) niklay to ham ne kaha ke tum Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas jao aur un ko khabar do ke do aurtein darwazay par poochti hain ke agar apne shoharon aur un yateemon ko dein jin ko wo paaltay hain, ko sadqa dein to ada ho jaye ga ya nahi? Aur Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko ye na batana ke ham log kaun hain. Zainab ne kaha ke Bilal (raziyallahu anhu) gaye aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poocha to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke wo kaun hain? To Bilal (raziyallahu anhu) ne arz kiya ke aik Ansaar ki aurat hai aur doosri Zainab (raziyallahu anha). Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke kaun si Zainab hain? Unhon ne kaha ke Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) ki biwi. Tab Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Bilal (raziyallahu anhu) se farmaya ke un ko us mein dogna sawab hai. Aik to qarabat walon se sulook karnay ka aur doosra sadqa karnay ka. (Muslim)."
"529","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abu Talha Ansari (raziyallahu anhu) Madina mein bohat maaldaar thay aur bohat mehbub maal un ka Bairuha aik baagh tha, jo Masjid-e-Nabawi ke aagay tha. Aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us mein jatay aur us ka meetha pani peetay thay. Anas (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke jab ye aayat utri ke: Na pahunchay ge tum neki ki had ko jab tak ke na kharch karo ge apni mehbub cheezon ko Allah ki raah mein. To Abu Talha (raziyallahu anhu) ne kharay ho kar Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se arz kiya ke Allah Taala farmata hai ke: Tum neki ki had ko na pahunchay ge jab tak apne mehbub maal na kharch karo. Aur mere sab maalon se zyada mehbub Bairuha hai, wo Allah ki raah mein sadqa hai aur main Allah se us ke sawab aur aakhirat mein us ke zakheera ho janay ka umeedwaar hun. So Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us ko jahan chahein rakh dein. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke ye to baray nafa ka maal hai. Ye to baray nafa ka maal hai. Main ne suna jo tum ne kaha aur main munasib janta hun ke tum usay apne azeezon mein baant do. Phir us ko Abu Talha (raziyallahu anhu) ne apne azeezon aur chacha zaad bhaiyon mein baant diya. (Muslim: 3/79). Baab: Maamon par sadqa."
"530","[AI-translation] Maimuna bint Haris (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke zamana mein aik londi azaad ki aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saamnay us ka zikr kiya to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Agar tum usay apne maamon ko de detein to tumharay liye zyada ajar ka baais banta. (Muslim)."
"531","[AI-translation] Asma bint Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poocha ke meri maan aayi hai aur wo deen se bezaar hai, doosri riwayaton mein aaya hai ke wo mushrika hai, to kya main us se sulook aur ehsaan karun? To Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke haan. (Muslim)."
"532","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke aik shakhs aaya aur us ne Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poocha ke meri maan fauran mar gayi aur wasiyat na karnay paayi, agar bolti to sadqa deti. Agar main un ki taraf se sadqa dun to usay sawab ho ga? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya haan. (Muslim)."
"533","[AI-translation] Jarir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Din ke shuru hissa mein ham Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas thay. Kuch log aaye jo nangay pair, nangay badan, galay mein chamray ki chaadrein pehni hui, apni talwarein latkayi hui, aksar balke sab un mein qabeela Muzar ke log thay. Un ke faqr o faqa ko dekh kar Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka chehra-e-mubarak badal gaya. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) andar aa gaye phir bahar aaye. Yani pareshan ho gaye, SubhanAllah kya shafqat thi aur kaisi hamdardi thi. Aur Bilal (raziyallahu anhu) ko hukm farmaya ke azaan kaho phir takbeer kahi aur namaz padhi aur khutba padha aur ye aayat padhi ke Ae logon! Allah se daro jis ne tumhein aik jaan se banaya, is liye padhi ke maloom ho ke saaray Bani Adam aapas mein bhai bhai hain, aakhir aayat tak. Phir Surah Hashr ki ye aayat padhi ke: Ae iman walo! Allah se daro aur ghaur karo ke tum ne apni jaanon ke liye aagay kya bhej rakha hai jo kal, qayamat ke din tumharay, kaam aaye. Phir sadqaat ka bazaar garam ho gaya. Kisi ne ashrafi di, kisi ne dirham, kisi ne aik sa' geehun aur kisi ne aik sa' khajoor dena shuru ki, yahan tak ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke aik tukra bhi khajoor ka ho, to wo bhi bataur sadqa ke lao. Phir Ansaar mein se aik shakhs thaili laya ke us ka haath thaka jata tha balke thak gaya tha. Phir to logon ne taar baandh liya yahan tak ke main ne do dhair dekhay khanay aur kapray ke yahan tak, sadqaat jama hue, ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke chehra-e-mubarak ko main dekhta tha ke chamaknay laga tha goya ke sonay ka ho gaya ho jaisay kundan. Phir Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke jo shakhs Islam ki naik kaam ki ibtida karay, yani kitab o sunnat ki baat, us ke liye apne amal ka bhi sawab hai aur jo log us ke baad amal karein, us ki dekha dekhi, un ka bhi sawab hai baghair us ke ke un logon ka kuch sawab ghatay. Aur jis ne Islam mein aa kar buri chaal daali, yani jis se kitab o sunnat ne roka hai, to us ke upar us ke amal ka bhi baar hai aur un logon ka bhi jo us ke baad amal karein baghair us ke ke un logon ka kuch baar ghatay. (Muslim)."
"534","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aik aadmi ne maidaan mein baadal mein se ye aawaz suni ke falan shakhs ke baagh ko pani pila de. Us aawaz ke baad baadal aik taraf chala aur aik pathreeli zameen mein pani barsaya. Aik naali wahan ki naaliyon mein se bilkul labalaab ho gayi. So wo shakhs barastay pani ke peechay peechay gaya, achanak aik mard ko dekha ke apne baagh mein khara pani ko apne phaoray se idhar udhar karta hai. Us ne baagh walay mard se kaha ke Ae Allah ke banday! Tera naam kya hai? Us ne kaha falan naam hai, wohi naam jo baadal mein suna tha. Phir baagh walay ne us shakhs se kaha ke Ae Allah ke banday! Tu ne mera naam kyun poocha? Wo bola ke main ne baadal mein se aik aawaz suni, koi keh raha tha ke falan shakhs ke baagh ko pani pila de, aur us kehnay walay ne, tera naam liya. So tu us baagh mein Allah Taala ke ehsaan ki kya shukarguzari karta hai? Baagh walay ne kaha ke jab ke tu ne ye kaha to ab main bayan karta hun. Main dekhta hun jo us baagh se aamdani hoti hai, us ka aik tihayi sadqa karta hun aur aik tihayi mere biwi bachay khatay hain aur aik tihayi baagh par lagata hun. Hadees se maloom hua ke maal ka tihayi hissa Allah ki raah mein sarf karna behtar hai aur ye bhi maloom hua ke farishtay Allah Taala ke hukm ke muwafiq pani barsatay hain aik hi maqam mein aik jagah zyada aur aik jagah kam barasta hai. Aik doosri riwayat mein hai ke aik tihayi mein miskeenon, sailon aur musafiron mein sarf karta hun. (Muslim). (Harra se murad pathreeli zameen hai; sharja se murad naali hai; mishaat se murad phaora hai.)"
"535","[AI-translation] Adi bin Hatim (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne jahannam ka zikr farmaya aur napasandeedgi se munh doosri taraf pher liya. Phir farmaya ke aag, jahannam ki aag, se bacho. Phir napasandeedgi se munh pher liya, yahan tak ke ham ne gumaan kiya ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us, naar-e-jahannam, ki taraf dekh rahay hain. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke jahannam se bacho, agar jahannam se bachnay ke liye koi aur cheez na ho to, khajoor ke daanay ka aik hissa hi ho, wohi sadqa kar ke bhi bachna paray to bach jao. Agar kisi ko ye bhi na milay to achi baat hi keh kar, hi jahannam ki aag se bacho. (Muslim)."
"536","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat kartay hain ke beshak jo kisi ghar walon ko aisi oontni deta hai jo subah aur shaam aik bara pyala bhar doodh deti hai to us ka bohat bara sawab hai. (Muslim)."
"537","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat kartay hain ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Saat qism ke log aisay hain ke Allah Taala un ko apne saya mein jagah de ga, yani arsh ke neechay, jis din us ke siwa aur koi saya na ho ga. Aik to haakim-e-munsif, jo kitab o sunnat ke mutabiq faisla karay khwah badshah ho khwah kotwal ho, doosray wo jawan jo Allah ki ibadat ke saath barha ho, teesray wo shakhs jis ka dil masjid hi mein laga rahay, chauthay wo do shakhs jo aapas mein Allah ke wastay mohabbat karein aur usi ke liye milein aur usi ke liye juda hon, paanchwin wo shakhs, jo mard aisa muttaqi ho, ke usay koi hasab nasab wali maaldaar aurat zina ke liye bulaye aur wo kahay ke main Allah se darta hun, aur zina se baaz rahay, chhatay wo shakhs jo sadqa aisay chhupa kar de ke baayein haath ko khabar na ho ke daayein haath ne kya kharch kiya, saatwin jo Allah ko akelay mein yaad karay aur us ke aansu tapak parein, Allah ki mohabbat ya khauf ki wajah se. (Muslim: 3/93). Baab: Tandrust bakheel ke sadqa ki fazilat. (Zill-e-arsh murad hai; sahi alfaaz ye hain ke baayein ko khabar na ho.)"
"538","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aik shakhs aaya aur arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam)! Afzal aur sawab mein bara sadqa kaun sa hai? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke tu sadqa de aur tu tandrust aur harees ho, mohtaji ka khauf karta ho aur ameeri ki umeed rakhta ho. Aur tu yahan tak sadqa denay mein dair na karay ke jab jaan, halaq yani, galay mein aa jaye to kehnay lagay ke ye falan ka hai, ye maal falan ko do aur wo to khud ab falan ka ho chuka, yani tere martay hi waris log le lein ge. (Muslim)."
"539","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, bayan kartay hain ke jab Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs apni pakeeza, halaal, kamayi se aik khajoor bhi sadqa karta hai to Allah Taala usay apne daayein haath mein pakar kar us ki is tarah tarbiyat karta hai jis tarah tum mein se koi apne ghoray ke bachray ya jawan oontni ko paalta hai. Hatta ke wo, aik khajoor ka sadqa, pahar ki tarah ho jata hai ya us se bhi barh jata hai. (Muslim). (Falo se murad ghora ka bacha hai; qaloos se murad jawan oontni hai.)"
"540","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ae logon! Allah Taala paak hai, yani sifaat-e-hudoos aur sifaat-e-naqs o zawaal se, aur nahi qabool karta magar paak maal, yani halaal ko, aur Allah paak ne mominon ko wohi hukm kiya jo mursaleen ko hukm kiya aur farmaya ke: Ae Rasoolon ki jamaat! Khao pakeeza cheezein aur naik amal karo main tumharay kaamon ko janta hun. Aur farmaya ke: Ae iman walo khao paak cheezein jo ham ne tumhein dein. Phir zikr kiya aisay mard ka jo ke lambay lambay safar karta hai, paraganda haal hai, gard o ghubaar mein bhara hai aur phir haath aasmaan ki taraf uthata hai aur kehta hai ke Ae Rab, Ae Rab! Halanke us ka khana haraam hai, peena haraam hai, us ka libas haraam hai aur us ki ghiza haraam hai phir us ki dua kaisay qabool ho? (Muslim: 3/85-86)"
"541","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ae Musalman aurto! Koi tum mein se apne hamsaye ko haqeer na janay agarchay bakri ka aik khur hi de. Yani na lenay wala us ko haqeer samajh kar inkaar karay na denay wala sharminda ho kar denay se baaz rahay. (Muslim). (Khuff se murad khur hai.)"
"542","[AI-translation] Abu Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hamein sadqa ka hukm diya gaya, aur ham bojh dhoya kartay thay. Abu Aqeel (raziyallahu anhu) ne aadha sa' sadqa diya, yani sawa sair, aur aik shakhs ne us se zyada diya. To munafiq kehnay lagay ke Allah ko us ke sadqa ki kuch parwa nahi hai aur us doosray ne to sirf dikhanay ko hi sadqa diya hai. Phir ye aayat utri ke: Jo log taan kartay hain khushi se sadqa denay walay mominon ko aur un logon ko jo nahi patay hain magar apni mazdoori. (Muslim: 2/83-84)."
"543","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke jis ne aik jora kharch kiya, yani do paisay ya do rupiya ya do ashrafi, to jannat mein usay pukara jaye ga ke Ae Allah ke banday! Yahan aa tere liye yahan khair o khoobi hai. Phir jo namaz ka aadi hai wo namaz ke darwaza se pukara jaye ga, aur jo jihad ka aadi hai wo jihad ke darwaza se pukara jaye ga, aur jo sadqa ka aadi hai wo sadqa ke darwaza se pukara jaye ga aur jo roza ka aadi hai wo roza ke darwaza se pukara jaye ga. To Abu Bakr Siddiq (raziyallahu anhu) ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam)! Kisi ke tamam darwazon se pukaray janay ki zaroorat to nahi hai, phir bhi kya koi aisa ho ga jo sab darwazon se pukara jaye ga? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke haan aur main, Allah ke fazl se, umeed rakhta hun ke tum unhi mein se ho ge. (Muslim: 3/91). Baab: Har neki sadqa hai."
"544","[AI-translation] Huzaifa (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat kartay hain ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Har neki sadqa hai. (Muslim)."
"545","[AI-translation] Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke chand ashaab Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaye aur arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam)! Maal walay to ajar o sawab maal loot le gaye. Is liye ke wo namaz padhtay hain jaisay ham padhtay hain aur roza rakhtay hain jaisay ham roza rakhtay hain aur apne zaaid maalon mein se sadqa detay hain. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke tumharay liye bhi to Allah Taala ne sadqa ka samaan kar diya hai ke har tasbeeh, yani SubhanAllah kehna, sadqa hai, har takbeer sadqa hai, har tahmeed, yani Alhamdulillah kehna, sadqa hai, har baar, La ilaha illallah, kehna sadqa hai, achi baat sikhana sadqa hai, buri baat se rokna sadqa hai aur har shakhs ke haq-e-zaujiyat ada karnay mein sadqa hai. Logon ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam)! Ham mein se koi apni shahwat se haq-e-zaujiyat ada karay, yani apni biwi se sohbat karta hai, to kya us mein bhi sawab hai? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya kyun nahi? Dekho to agar usay haraam mein sarf kar le to gunah ho ga ke nahi? Usi tarah jab halaal mein sarf karta hai to sawab hota hai. (Muslim). (Muslim mein binisf hai.)"
"546","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Har aadmi ke badan mein teen sau saath jor hain. So jis ne, Allahu Akbar, kaha, Alhamdulillah kaha, La ilaha illallah kaha, SubhanAllah kaha, Astaghfirullah kaha, pathar logon ki raah se hata diya ya koi kaanta ya haddi raah se hata di ya achi baat sikhayi ya us ka hukm diya, ya buri baat se roka to ye teen sau saath joron ki ginti ke barabar hai, yani shukr ada karnay ke barabar hai, aur us din wo us haal mein chal raha hota hai ke wo apni jaan ko jahannam se azaad karwa chuka hota hai. Abu Tauba ne apni riwayat mein ye bhi kaha ke wo usi haal mein shaam karta hai, ke wo jahannam se azaad hota hai. (Muslim)."
"547","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat kartay hain ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aik shakhs ne kaha ke main aaj ki raat kuch sadqa dun ga. Wo apna sadqa le kar nikla, ye sadqa ko chhupana manzoor tha ke raat ko le kar nikla, aur aik zinakaar aurat ke haath mein de diya. Phir subah ko log charcha karnay lagay ke aaj ki raat aik shakhs zinakaar aurat ke haath sadqa de gaya. Us ne kaha ke Ae Allah! Sab khoobiyan tere liye hain ke mera sadqa zinakaar ko ja para. Phir us ne kaha ke aaj aur sadqa dun ga. Phir nikla aur aik ghani maaldaar ko de diya. Aur log subah ko charcha karnay lagay ke aaj koi maaldaar ko sadqa de gaya. Us ne kaha ke Ae Allah! Sab khoobiyan tere liye hain mera sadqa maaldaar ke haath ja para. Teesray din phir us ne kaha ke main sadqa dun ga. Aur wo nikla aur sadqa aik chor ke haath mein de diya. Subah ko log charcha karnay lagay ke aaj koi chor ko sadqa de gaya. Us ne kaha ke Ae Allah! Sab khoobiyan tere hi liye hain ke mera sadqa zinakaar aurat, maaldaar shakhs aur chor ke haath mein ja para. Phir us ke paas aik shakhs aaya, yani farishta ya us zamana ke Nabi (alaihissalam), aur us se kaha ke tere sab sadqay qabool ho gaye. Zinakaar ka to is liye ke shayad wo us zina se baaz rahi ho, is liye ke pait ke liye zina karti thi. Raha ghani to us ka is liye qabool hua ke shayad usay sharam aaye aur ibrat ho ke aur log sadqa detay hain to main bhi dun. Aur wo Allah Taala ke diye hue maal mein se kharch karay. Aur chor ka is liye ke shayad wo chori se baaz aa jaye, is liye ke aaj ka kharch to aa gaya. (Muslim: 3/89-90). Baab: Sadqa denay walay aur bakheel ki misaal."
"548","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Bakheel aur sadqa denay walay ki misaal aisi hai jaisay do aadmi ke jin par lohay ki zirahein hon. Phir jab sakhi ne chaha sadqa de to us ki zirah kushaada ho gayi, yahan tak ke us ke qadmon ka asar mitanay lagi. Aur jab bakheel ne chaha ke sadqa de to wo tang ho gayi aur us ke haath us ke galay mein phans gaye aur har halqa apne doosray halqay mein ghus gaya. Rawi-e-hadees, Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu), ne kaha ke main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farmatay thay ke phir wo koshish karta hai ke kushaada ho magar wo kushaada nahi hoti. (Muslim)."
"549","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Har roz do farishtay utartay hain. Aik to ye kehta hai ke Ae Allah! Kharch karnay walay ko aur de aur doosra ye kehta hai ke Ae Allah! Bakheel ke maal ko tabah kar. (Muslim)."
"550","[AI-translation] Abu Musa Ashari (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat kartay hain ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Musalman amantdaar khazanchi, jo kharch karta ho. Aur kabhi farmatay ke wo deta ho jis ka, usay, hukm hua ho aur poori raqam deta ho, yani tehreer bata rishwat na kaatta ho, aur poori khairaat deta ho, apne dil ki khushi ke saath. Aur jis ko hukm hua ho us ko pahunchaye, to, wo bhi aik sadqa denay wala hai. (Muslim). (Qahrammaan Farsi mein khazanchi ko kehtay hain.)"
"551","[AI-translation] Asma bint Abu Bakr Siddiq (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke wo Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aayein aur arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mere paas kuch hai hi nahi maasiwa us ke jo Zubair (raziyallahu anhu) mujhe detay hain. Agar main us mein se kuch sadqa kar dun to mujhe gunah to nahi ho ga? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke jitna tum de sako de do, sainth kar na rakho aur de kar yaad na rakho warna Allah bhi sainth kar rakhay ga. (Muslim)."
"552","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab aurat apne ghar ke anaaj se baghair fasaad ke kharch karay, yani jitna dastoor hai jaisay faqeer ko tukra ya saail ko aik mutthi jis mein shohar ki raza aadat se maloom hoti hai, to us ko us ke kharch karnay ka sawab hota hai, aur shohar ko us ke kamanay ka. Aur khazanchi ko bhi usi ki misl ke aik ke sawab se doosray ka sawab na ghatay ga, yani har aik ko Allah Taala aik sawab de ga na ke aik ke sawab mein doosray ko shareek kar de ga. (Muslim)."
"553","[AI-translation] Umair jo Abu Lahm (raziyallahu anhu) ke azaad kardah ghulam hain, kehtay hain ke mujhe mere maalik, Abu Lahm, ne gosht sukhanay ka hukm diya. Aik faqeer aa gaya to main ne usay khanay ke muwafiq de diya. Jab maalik ko khabar hui to unhon ne mujhe maara. Main Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se bayan kiya, SubhanAllah Aap yateemon aur bewaon aur mazloomon ki amaan thay, to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhein bulaya aur farmaya ke tu ne usay kyun maara? Unhon ne kaha ke ye mera khana mere hukm ke baghair de deta hai. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke, us khairaat ka, tum donon ko sawab hai. (Muslim)."
"554","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Koi aurat, nafl, roza na rakhay jabke us ka shohar ghar mein maujood ho magar us ki ijazat se, rakhay, aur na us ke ghar mein kisi, apne mehram, ko aanay de jab wo ghar par ho magar us ki ijazat se, phir jab wo haazir na ho to badarja-e-aula us ke hukm aur raza ke jo pehle se maloom ho chuki ho, kisi ko aanay na dena chahiye, aur us ki kamayi se us ki ijazat ke baghair jo kuch kharch karti hai to us mein bhi us ke mard ko aadha sawab hai, yani mard ko kamanay ka aur aurat ko denay ka. (Muslim)."
"555","[AI-translation] Abu Sa'id Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Ansaar ke chand logon ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se kuch maanga to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhein diya. Unhon ne phir maanga to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne phir diya yahan tak ke jo kuch Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas tha, jab khatm ho gaya to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Mere paas jo maal hota hai to main tum se bacha kar nahi rakhta. Aur jo shakhs sawal se bachay Allah Taala usay bachata hai aur jo apne dil ko mustaghni beparwah rakhay to Allah Taala us ko mustaghni, beparwah, kar deta hai. Aur jo sabr ki aadat daalay, Allah Taala us par sabr aasaan kar deta hai. Aur koi ata-e-ilahi sabr se zyada behtar aur kushaadgi wali nahi hai. (Muslim)."
"556","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, duniya o aakhirat mein, kaamyab ho gaya wo shakhs jo Islam laya aur zaroorat ke muwafiq rizq diya gaya aur Allah Taala ne jo kuch usay diya us par qana kar diya. (Muslim)."
"557","[AI-translation] Muawiya (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum sawal mein chimtnay se bacho. Is liye ke Allah ki qasam jo mujh se koi cheez maangta hai aur us ke sawal ke sabab se mere paas se cheez kharch hoti hai aur main us ko bura janta hun, yani nakhushi se dun, to us mein barkat kaisay ho gi? (Muslim)."
"558","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se hamesha aik aadmi maangta rahay ga yahan tak ke Allah se milay ga aur us ke munh par gosht ka aik tukra bhi nahi ho ga. (Muslim)."
"559","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farmatay thay ke agar koi subah ko ja kar lakri ka aik gaththa apni peeth par laaday aur us se sadqa de aur apna kaam bhi nikalay ke logon ka mohtaaj na ho, ye us ke liye us se behtar hai ke logon se maangta phiray ke wo dein ya na dein aur bilashuba upar ka, denay wala, haath neechay, lenay, walay haath se behtar hai aur pehle sadqa us ko de jis ka kharch tere zimmay hai. (Muslim)."
"560","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam), us waqt, mimbar par sadqa ka aur kisi se sawal na karnay ka zikr kar rahay thay. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke upar ka haath neechay walay haath se behtar hai aur upar ka haath kharch karnay wala hai aur neechay ka haath maangnay wala hai. (Muslim)."
"561","[AI-translation] Hakeem bin Hizam (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se maal maanga to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujhe diya, main ne phir maanga to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne phir diya, main ne phir maanga to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne phir diya, phir farmaya ke ye maal sarsabz aur meetha hai. Pas jis ne us ko baghair maangay liya ya denay walay ki khushi se liya, na ke aap zabardasti taqaza kar ke liya, to us mein barkat hoti hai aur jis ne apne nafs ko zaleel kar ke, yani sawal kar ke ya chimat kar, liya to us mein barkat nahi hoti aur us ka maal aisa hota hai ke koi shakhs khata to hai lekin sair nahi hota aur upar ka haath neechay ke haath se umda hai. (Muslim)."
"562","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Miskeen wo nahi hai jo ghoomta rehta hai aur aik do luqma ya aik do khajoor le kar laut jata hai. Sahaba ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam)! Phir miskeen kaun hai? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke jis ko itna kharch nahi milta jo us ki zaroorat-e-bashri ki kifayat karta ho aur na log usay miskeen jantay hain ke us ko sadqa dein aur na wo logon se kuch maangta hai. (Muslim)."
"563","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ameeri samaan bohat honay se nahi hai balke ameeri dil ki be niyazi hai. (Muslim)."
"564","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ibn Adam, insaan, to boorha ho jata hai lekin us mein do cheezein jawan hoti rehti hain. Aik, maal ki, hirs aur doosri, lambi, umar ki hirs. (Muslim)."
"565","[AI-translation] Abu Aswad ne kaha ke Abu Musa Ashari (raziyallahu anhu) ne Basra ke qaariyon ko bulwaya to wo sab teen sau qaari un ke paas aaye jo Quran padh chukay thay. Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) ne un se kaha ke tum Basra ke sab logon se behtar ho aur wahan ke qaari ho, pas Quran padhtay raho aur bohat muddat guzar janay se sust na ho jao ke tumharay dil sakht ho jayein jaisay tum se pehlon ke dil sakht ho gaye aur ham aik soorat padha kartay thay jo tool mein aur sakht waeedon mein Baraat ke barabar thi. Phir main usay bhula diya gaya magar itni baat yaad rahi ke agar aadmi ke liye maal ke do maidaan hotay hain tab bhi teesra dhoondta rehta hai aur aadmi ka pait nahi bharta magar mitti se. Aur ham aik soorat aur padhtay thay aur us ko musabbihaat mein se aik soorat ke barabar jantay thay main wo bhi bhool gaya magar us mein se ye aayat yaad hai ke: Ae iman walo! Wo baat kyun kehtay ho jo kartay nahi. Jo aisi baat kehtay ho jo khud nahi kartay to, wo tumhari gardanon mein likh di jati hai gawahi ke taur par ke us ka tum se qayamat ke din sawal ho ga. (Muslim). (Mata-e-duniya murad hai.)"
"566","[AI-translation] Abu Sa'id Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne kharay ho kar logon mein waz kiya aur farmaya ke Ae logon! Allah ki qasam, main tumharay liye kisi aur cheez se nahi darta hun magar us se jo Allah Taala tumharay liye dunya ki zeenat nikalta hai. To aik shakhs ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam)! Kya khair ka nateeja sharr bhi hota hai? Yani duniya ki daulat aur hukumat ka hona aur Islam ki taraqqi hona to khair hai, us ka nateeja bura kyunkar ho ga. Phir Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) thori dair chup ho rahay. Phir farmaya ke tum ne kya kaha? Phir us ke sawal ko pooch liya ke kahin bhool na gaya ho to mutabiqat jawab ki sawal ke saath us ki samajh mein na aaye. Us ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam)! Kya khair ka nateeja sharr bhi hota hai? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke nahi khair ka nateeja to khair hi hota hai. Kya ye khair hai? Yani Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka maqsood ye tha ke ye to imtihan aur aazmaish hai aur imtihan aur aazmaish mein khair kahan hoti hai. Phir misaal de kar samjhaya ke mausam-e-bahaar mein jo sabza ugta hai, wo sabza janwar ko halaak kar deta hai siwa un janwaron ke jo sirf sabza, zaroorat ke mutabiq, khatay hain. Wo us qadar kha letay hain yahan tak ke un ki kokhein phool jati hain. Phir dhoop mein aa kar leed ya peshaab kartay hain, jugaali kartay hain aur phir ja kar charna shuru kar detay hain. Pas jo shakhs to maal haq ke saath leta hai, to us mein us ke liye barkat daal di jati hai. Aur jo shakhs nahaq le ga, us ki misaal us janwar ki misaal hai jo khata hai aur sair nahi hota, aur apni halaakat ka samaan paida kar leta hai. (Muslim). (Habat se murad badhazmi hai; yulimmu se murad halaakat ke qareeb hai; salat se murad patli leed hai; ijtarra se murad jugaali hai.)"
"567","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam), Umar bin Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) ko kuch maal diya kartay thay to Umar (raziyallahu anhu) arz kartay thay ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Mujh se zyada ehtiyaj rakhnay walay ko inayat kijiye. To Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke ye maal le lo aur khwah apne paas rakho, khwah sadqa de do. Aur jo us qism ke maal se tumharay paas aaye aur tum ne us ki khwahish nahi ki aur na sawal kiya ho to us ko le liya karo aur jo us tarah na ho, us ke peechay apne nafs ko mat lagao. Salim ne kaha ke isi wajah se Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) kisi se kuch na maangtay thay aur agar koi deta tha to radd na kartay thay. (Muslim: 3/98). Baab: Jis ke liye sawal halaal hai."
"568","[AI-translation] Qabeesa bin Mukhariq Hilali (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main aik bari raqam ka qarzdar ho gaya, yani do qabeelon ki islaah waghera ke liye ya kisi aur amr-e-khair ke wastay, to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap se sawal kiya. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke tum thehro ke hamaray paas sadqaat ka maal aaye ga to ham us mein se tumhein kuch denay ka hukm dein ge. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Ae Qabeesa! Sawal halaal nahi magar teen shakhson ko. Aik to wo jo qarzdar ho jaye, kisi amr-e-khair mein, to us ko sawal halaal ho jata hai yahan tak ke us ko itna maal mil jaye ke us ki guzraan durust ho jaye, phir sawal se baaz rahay. Doosray wo shakhs ke us ke maal mein aafat pahunchi ho ke us ka maal zaya ho gaya ho to us ko sawal halaal ho jata hai, yahan tak ke us ko itni raqam mil jaye ke us ki guzraan durust ho jaye. Ya lafz sadadan farmaya. Teesra wo shakhs ke us ko faqa pahuncha ho aur us ki qaum ke teen aqalmand shakhs gawahi dein ke beshak us ko faqa pahuncha hai to us ko bhi sawal jaaiz hai jab tak ke apni guzraan durust honay ke muwafiq na paye. Aur siwa un logon ke Ae Qabeesa! Sawal haraam hai, aur un ke siwa jo sawal karnay wala hai, wo haraam khata hai. (Muslim)."
"569","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath chala ja raha tha aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne aik Najran, naami sheher, ki chaadar orhi hui thi jis ka kinara mota tha. Achanak aik badwi aaya aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko chaadar samet us zor se khaincha yahan tak ke main ne Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki gardan ke mohray par chaadar, ke khainchnay, ka nishan dekha. Phir kaha ke Ae Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam)! Mere liye us maal mein se kuch denay ka hukm karo jo Allah ka diya Aap ke paas hai. Pas Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us ki taraf dekha aur hansay aur us ko kuch denay ka hukm kiya. (Muslim: 3/103). (Najran Hajaz aur Yaman ke darmiyan maqam hai; jabaza aur jazaba donon sahih hain.)"
"570","[AI-translation] Miswar bin Makhrama (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne chaadrein taqseem kein aur Makhrama (raziyallahu anhu) ko koi na di. Tab Makhrama (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Ae mere betay! Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) tak mere saath chalo. Pas main un ke saath gaya aur unhon ne kaha ke tum ghar mein ja kar Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko bulao. Main ne Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko bulaya. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) niklay aur un, chaadron, mein se aik chaadar orhay hue thay, aur farmaya ke ye main ne tumharay wastay rakh chhori thi aur phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Makhrama ko dekha aur farmaya Makhrama khush ho gaye. (Muslim: 3/103-104). (Qiba se murad pehnaawa hai.)"
